        "ggY8NkUsNXQ_childItem_2": "Can I cancel my order?",
        "ggY8NkUsNXQ_childItem_3": "I entered the wrong shipping address. How do I update this?",
        "ggY8NkUsNXQ_childItem_4": "How long will it take to get my preorder?",
        "ggt0HjHD6i6_text": "<p>Estimated shipping dates are listed on the preorder product page. We will ship as soon as the item(s) become available and you'll receive a tracking number via email. Ship dates are estimates and subject to change without notice.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-502691833529238472"
